  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei names Bull Demon when Longevity Heaven summons him and Flower Lady against her during the Lang Ya conflict. He is a muscular brute with a thick beard and a thunderous voice, extremely tall and strong, and he laughs that since she can move around, so can the two of them. With Flower Lady he forces Zi Wei to retreat in a chain of explosions while Longevity Heaven holds the advantage of fresh condition.",
      "chapters": [
        1583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_flower_lady",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a muscular brute with a thick beard, a thunderous voice, and an extremely tall, strong frame with powerful aura. Flower Lady sits on his shoulder.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bull Demon and Flower Lady take the North Desolation Immortal role together among Longevity Heaven’s Four Desolation Immortals, posts meant for rank eight Gu Immortals. When Bing Sai Chuan awakens as West Desolation Immortal, they greet him as Senior West Desolation.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-posting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_north_desolation_immortal",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_west_desolation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Court with the Northern Desolation Immortals, he explains Central Heaven Gate recruitment and Golden Pearl Immortal King’s golden pearl soldiers. He activates a method through Calamity Luck Altar that forms auspicious clouds and pushes the pearl soldiers away, then goes with Flower Lady to break into Sun Palace while Bing Sai Chuan clears a path.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_central_heaven_gate",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "loc_sun_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan sends him with Five Elements Grandmaster against the fate Gu refinement path formation. He fights Cong Yan and urges Five Elements Grandmaster to attack to lure attention. After Flower Lady dies and then revives as a flower that becomes a little girl inside Heaven Overseeing Tower, narration states their biggest secret: they share lifespan, and if one dies while the other lives, the dead one revives after some time.",
      "chapters": [
        1720
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shared-lifespan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_cong_yan",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later Bing Sai Chuan orders him and Five Elements Grandmaster to return when luck path light fades and Heavenly Court presses in.",
      "chapters": [
        1733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shared-lifespan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
